# WooCommerce WhatsApp Direct Order Button

A custom WordPress & WooCommerce plugin that adds a direct "Contact us on WhatsApp" button to single product pages, streamlining customer inquiries and boosting store conversions.

## 🚀 Key Features
- **Seamless WooCommerce Integration:** Hooks directly into the single product summary without modifying core theme files.
- **Dynamic Product Context:** Automatically captures the product title and URL so the store owner immediately knows which item the customer is inquiring about.
- **Clean & Lightweight:** Built with pure PHP and minimal CSS for zero impact on page load speed.
- **Admin Settings:** Configurable WhatsApp phone number and custom button text directly from the WordPress dashboard.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used
- **Backend:** PHP, WordPress & WooCommerce Hooks (`woocommerce_single_product_summary`)
- **Frontend:** HTML5, CSS3

## 📦 Installation
1. Upload the plugin folder to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory.
2. Activate the plugin through the **Plugins** menu in WordPress.
3. Configure your WhatsApp number in the plugin settings.

